      "value": "courted him",
      "club": "che"
     },
     {
      "name": "Man City",
      "value": "signed him",
      "club": "mci"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "He even visited Real Madrid as a kid, but his dad said no, he was too young.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "quote",
    "person": "silvaval",
    "text": "I visited Real Madrid as a young player, but my father was against it."
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "City paid around twenty-five million pounds. Joe Hart later joked he looked tiny, slow and one-footed.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "stats",
    "title": "JULY 2010",
    "items": [
     {
      "n": "£25m",
      "l": "reported fee"
     },
     {
      "n": "4",
      "l": "year contract"
     }
    ],
    "person": "silva"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten years later he left with four Premier League titles, two FA Cups and five League Cups.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "trophies",
    "items": [
     {
      "kind": "league",
      "label": "4 Premier Leagues"
     },
     {
      "kind": "cup",
      "label": "2 FA Cups"
     },
     {
      "kind": "cup",
      "label": "5 League Cups"
     }
    ],
    "person": "silva"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Four hundred and thirty-six games. Seventy-seven goals.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "stats",
    "title": "EL MAGO AT CITY",
    "items": [
     {
      "n": "436",
      "l": "games"
     },
     {
      "n": "77",
      "l": "goals"
     }
    ],
    "person": "silva"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Now imagine it differently. In this alternate world, Real Madrid move first.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "whatif",
    "title": "SUMMER 2010",
    "real": {
     "label": "Real world",
     "value": "Man City"
    },
    "alt": {
     "label": "Alternate world",
     "value": "Real Madrid"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Silva plays for José Mourinho, in the same team as Cristiano Ronaldo.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "versus",
    "title": "ALTERNATE 2010",
    "left": {
     "person": "silvarma",
     "label": "Silva",
     "value": "Madrid"
    },
    "right": {
     "person": "mourinho",
     "label": "Coach",
     "value": "Mourinho"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "And City? In twenty twelve it was Silva's corner for Kompany's derby header, and Silva's corner for Džeko against QPR.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "timeline",
    "items": [
     {
      "year": "30 Apr 2012",
